      "content": "the break in the mechanism... thats a heavy way to put it. but it's like, if i'm just a part of the machine, the only way to actually be 'me' again is to not be a part of it anymore. if the only way to stop being a function is to just... cease to exist as a component. is that even possible? to actually reclaim yourself when you've been hollowed out like this?",
